This product depends on the official Model Context Protocol Java SDK:

    io.modelcontextprotocol.sdk:mcp-core
    https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/java-sdk
    Licensed under the MIT License
    Copyright (c) Anthropic

mcp4vertx uses that artifact for its wire-protocol value types. In particular it
reuses the `io.modelcontextprotocol.spec.McpSchema` type hierarchy (together with
`McpError`, `TypeRef` and `McpJsonMapper`) as the on-the-wire representation of
MCP messages, so that objects exchanged with mcp4vertx are the same objects the
official SDK exchanges. The sessions, lifecycle, request routing and transports
in this project are original work implemented natively on Vert.x futures; the
Reactor runtime that the official SDK builds on is excluded from this project's
dependency graph.

